      en: ["The city was formed in 1947 by the merger of four mining villages.", "The Turul Monument has an impressive wingspan of nearly 15 meters.", "The mining museum is the first open-air museum of its kind in Hungary.", "Szelim Cave was inhabited by humans as early as the Stone Age.", "Tatabánya is located on the M1 motorway between Budapest and Vienna.", "The Gerecse mountains offer numerous professional rock climbing routes."],
      es: ["El monumento Turul en Tatabánya es la estatua de bronce más grande de un ave en Europa.", "La cueva de Szelim es un monumento paleontológico importante situado junto al ave Turul.", "La ciudad tiene una larga historia minera documentada en el museo minero al aire libre.", "Tatabánya es un nudo importante en la línea ferroviaria Viena-Budapest."],
