      en: ["The National Stud was officially established on October 24, 1789.", "The Shagya-Arabian horse breed was developed here during the 19th century.", "The castle garden features one of Hungary's oldest acacia trees, planted around 1710.", "The indoor riding hall was constructed in 1809 in a neoclassical style.", "Bábolna was granted town status in the year 2003.", "The stud complex includes a museum and a significant collection of historical coaches."],
      es: ["La Yeguada Nacional de Bábolna es el hogar de los famosos caballos Shagya-Árabe.", "Fue fundada en 1789 por decreto imperial como instalación militar independiente.", "El museo del palacio alberga una colección de hipología de importancia mundial.", "El conjunto de la yeguada de Bábolna está bajo protección nacional."],
