      en: ["The Reformed Great Church was constructed between 1835 and 1870.", "The Kossuth Museum preserves over 1,200 personal items belonging to the statesman.", "The settlement was first mentioned in historical records in 1290.", "The medicinal water in Cegléd emerges from the ground at 54 degrees Celsius.", "The town is home to Hungary's only Drum Museum, an internationally unique site.", "Cegléd is located approximately 70 kilometers southeast of Budapest."],
