      en: ["The name refers to over 100 tumuli from the Hallstatt culture.", "The Danube Refinery is the largest oil processing plant in Hungary.", "The Archaeological Park was opened in 1996 as the first of its kind.", "The Dunamenti Power Plant is a major contributor to the national grid.", "The town hosts the Summerfest International Folklore Festival annually.", "Százhalombatta is located on the right bank of the Danube River."],
